# CARE — Classroom AI for Reports & Engagement
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values.
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# All settings below can also be changed live from the ⚙ Settings tab in the
# app. Values saved through the UI are stored in the database and take priority
# over these environment variables — so you only need this file for the initial
# setup or for automated / Docker deployments.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── API Key ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Paste the key for your chosen AI provider here.
# The Settings tab supports: OpenRouter · OpenAI · Google Gemini · Anthropic ·
#                            Groq · Ollama (no key needed) · Custom endpoint
#
# OpenRouter (recommended for beginners — one key, many models, free tier):
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# If you use OpenAI, Groq, Google Gemini or Anthropic directly, put that key
# here instead (or enter it in the Settings tab):
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# GROQ_API_KEY=
# GOOGLE_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# ── Model ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Default AI model. Change here or from the Settings tab.
# OpenRouter examples:  openai/gpt-4o-mini  |  anthropic/claude-3-5-haiku  |  google/gemini-2.0-flash-exp
# OpenAI direct:        gpt-4o-mini
# Google Gemini direct: gemini-2.0-flash
# Anthropic direct:     claude-haiku-4-5-20251001
# Groq:                 llama-3.1-70b-versatile
# Ollama (local):       llama3.2
MODEL=openai/gpt-4o-mini

# ── Database path (optional override) ────────────────────────────────────────
# Default: data/class_assist.db (relative to the project root).
# Override if you want the database outside the project folder.
# DB_PATH=/data/care/class_assist.db
